invalid type: string "On 2026-08-03, a routing decision was made for shipment SHP0001 transiting Strait of Hormuz. The assessed disruption risk probability was 30%. Cargo value was $966,956.00. Expected cost to stay on the current route: $36,357.55. Expected cost to reroute: $104,454.10. The final decision was to 'stay', with an estimated savings of $68,096.56 compared to the alternative option.ÿÿ